# Proposed nominal dry Engine audition; 48000 frames at 48000 Hz (one second).
# Note-only: do not replace any saved expression, drawbar, route or preset.
# Upper solo, Lower solo, pedal solo, then a brief combined cadence.
# Manual numbers are MIDI notes; pedal numbers are one-based IDs, not MIDI.
0 note_on upper 60 100
7200 note_off upper 60 0
9000 note_on upper 67 100
14400 note_off upper 67 0
16000 note_on lower 48 100
24000 note_off lower 48 0
26000 pedal_on lower 1 100
34000 pedal_off lower 1 0
36000 note_on upper 64 100
36000 note_on lower 55 100
36000 pedal_on lower 8 100
44000 note_off upper 64 0
44000 note_off lower 55 0
44000 pedal_off lower 8 0
